\r\ns------e--- OK (1   out of 1  , remaining: 00:00, took 1.048s, duration: 00:01)\r\n```\r\n\r\n@jay would you mind testing it again?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/802842594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mback2k","id":231943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTk0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k","html_url":"https://github.com/mback2k","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mback2k/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4482295228,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NDQ4MjI5NTIyOA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/events/4482295228","actor":{"login":"jay","id":965580,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTU4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/965580?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay","html_url":"https://github.com/jay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht